OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board chief executive drops
OL,4,Anew NHS job after critical report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive of Wales's largest
OL,7,Fhealth board will no longer take up a
OL,8,Fnew post in England, following a
OL,9,Fdamning review of her current
OL,10,Forganisation's leadership.
OL,12,FCarol Shillabeer, who has been Betsi
OL,13,FCadwaladr University Health Board's
OL,14,Fchief executive since May 2023, had
OL,15,Fbeen due to lead the Lancashire and
OL,16,FSouth Cumbria NHS Trust in England in
OL,17,Fthe new year.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
