OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board chief executive drops
OL,4,Anew NHS job after critical report
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a review into the Welsh health
OL,7,Fboard found that, in some parts,
OL,8,Ftargets and money had a "greater
OL,9,Fpriority for senior management than the
OL,10,Fquality and safety of care".
OL,12,FThe Lancashire and South Cumbria Trust
OL,13,Fsaid the "seriousness of the findings"
OL,14,Fcould not be ignored and Shillabeer
OL,15,Fmade the "personal decision" to
OL,16,Fwithdraw from the role.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
